// Asymmetric VCCS coverage: three inverter current sources — two 1-phase units
// on different phases with different Ppct plus a 3-phase unit — with unequal
// per-phase resistive loads. Curves inlined from the corpus VCCS library
// (Version8/Distrib/Examples/VCCS/HW_Inverters.txt) so the deck is
// self-contained.
